window.products.push({"id":974225,"name":"Dreametech L10 Pro Robot Vacuum and Mop, 4000Pa Strong Suction, 2.5h Runtime, Works with Alexa/Google Home/APP, 3D Obstacle Avoidance, Superb LiDAR Na","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":250.51,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fA91YhL9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【4000Pa Strong Suction】4000Pa Strong suction easily lifts dust and pet hair from floors or deep inside the carpet. L10 Pro has 4 levels of suction, you can adjust the level of suction according to the degree of dirt. 【Vacuuming, Sweeping, and Mopping 3-in-1】270ml Large water tank + 570ml Dust tank size + 3 Levels of adjusted water flows; Robot vacuum with an effective sweeping and mopping configuration, Simultaneous dry & Wet Cleaning, which makes your house cleaning more thorough. 【150-min Runtime & Self Charging】L10 Pro with a 5200 mAh battery, and up to 150 mins of working time. It cleans 2690 sqft and mops 2152 sqft in standards mode when the robot vacuum charges fully. L10 Pro returns to the charging base automatically when it's on a low battery. Notice: Please charge the robot vacuum fully for 5-6 hours when you using it for the first time. (These data are from Dreametech's lab; it exists a slight difference due to the difference in using situation) 【Superb Lidar Navigation & SLAM Algorithm】L10 Pro adopts high precision 3D Obstacle Avoidance Technology and dual-line LiDAR technology; it avoids colliding with electric wire, furniture, garbage cans, shoes, etc in the process of cleaning, so you don't worry about the breaking of the robot vacuum's body and furniture; Intelligent SLAM Algorithm provides the function of \"s\" shape route planning, so L10 Pro clean your room in an orderly manner. 【Wifi & Smart Voice App Control】L10 Pro Robot Vacuum Compatible with Alexa and Google Assistant. App remote control allows you to adjust the suction power and water output of the water tank, set up virtual walls/restricted areas, etc. Once connected to Alexa or Google Assistant, the robot responds to your voice orders immediately. L10 Pro Robot Vacuum works with 2.4GHz Wifi. 【What's in the Box】 1*L10 Pro, 1*Charging Dock, 1*Cleaning Tool, 1*Power Cord, 1*Water Tank, 1*Mop Pad, 1*Side Brush. Note: we offer a 1-year warranty for Dreametech L10 Pro.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fA91YhL9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dreametech","source_asin":"B0BMQ4VYPR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-974225","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMQ4VYPR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMQ4VYPR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
