window.products.push({"id":974285,"name":"Kitchen Science Moscow Mule Copper Mugs Set of 4 (16oz) w/ 4 Straws & 1 Jigger | 100% Pure Copper Cups, Tarnish-Resistant, Ergonomic Handle (No Rivet)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bYlpF6fnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✓ PREMIUM 100% COPPER MUGS | PERFECT HOME BAR DISPLAY: Very durable and well-made to withstand everyday practical use. There’s nothing like a good Moscow Mule in an authentic 100% copper cup just like how it came about originally back in 1941! With their luster, they make a great addition to your bar accessories and a standout centerpiece for your home bar display! ✓ FOOD GRADE LACQUER-COATED & TARNISH-RESISTANT: US-based third party lab-tested and certified for food safety. Copper mugs are naturally prone to tarnishing over time. But purposefully designed to withstand tarnish, rust or stain, our copper mugs feature a proprietary food grade lacquer coating in both its interior and exterior. With its added coating and with proper care, it will keep its lustrous beauty worthy of a bar display! ✓ ERGONOMIC WELDED HANDLE (NO RIVET): Designed to provide a solid comfortable grip! Our mug has a good balanced weight to it. Each copper mug is unique with its own hammered pattern. And each goes through a standard 21-point quality assurance check before it gets shipped to you. ✓ WHAT YOU GET: This mugs set comes with 6 mugs, 6 straws & 1 jigger. Premium Moscow Mule cups with added accessories, ideal copper kitchen accessories, beautifully handcrafted by our expert coppersmiths! Our 22-gauge thick Moscow Mule cocktail glasses feature a smooth rounded rim. Serving your cocktail in copper mugs makes a great experience for a hit party! ✓ LIFETIME WARRANTY: We are an American family-owned small business and we take pride in our product! We have developed the industry's first ever 21-point quality checklist to ensure that you get the very best Moscow Mule cups which last long. To demonstrate our confidence, we offer a NO QUESTIONS ASKED 100% REFUND GUARANTEE. If you are not happy with our product for any reason, just let us know and we will give you a refund. Don't trust us? Just look at our near perfect reviews.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bYlpF6fnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitchen Science","source_asin":"B0BJ7Y6RH2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-974285","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ7Y6RH2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ7Y6RH2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
