window.products.push({"id":974392,"name":"Zerosky Ozone Refrigerator Deodorizer, 20mg/H O3 Air Purifier Deodorizer, Natural Car, Shoe Deodorizer, Odor Eliminators For Home, Closet, Pet Home, W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619C9nNZM7S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【How to use our Ozone Refrigerator Deodorizer ?】STEP 1: charge for 12 hours; STEP 2: put in the refrigerator or other enclosed spaces where you want to remove odors; STEP 3: wait for 3-7 days. TIPS: Please give Ozone Refrigerator Deodorizer some patience and time, of course, 7 days is enough. 【Healthy & Reusable Ozone Generator Deodorizer】Unlike other deodorizing methods, ozone actually searches out and destroys problem gases. If the molecules are stinky ones, they can change to be non-smelly aka neutral, like H2O (water) and O2(oxygen). Continuously produce ozone through electrolysis technology. Just charge it and use it. The service life is as long as 3-5 years. 【Refrigerator Deodorizer】The ozone generator is an eco-friendly design that through high technology, the oxygen in the air is converted into ozone, which can be recycled and used without invisible consumption, to keep energy consumption to the minimum. 【Easy to Use & Easy to Carry】 Our Ozone Generator Deodorizer can be used by clicking the power button witch charged once in 14-17 days. The Air Purifier Deodorizer has two modes to choose from cycle mode and powerful mode. Does not take up any storage space. 5.9\"*1.36\"*2.36\" (half of the size of a palm for adults). You can take Our Ozone Generator Deodorizer wherever you want. Bring convenience to your family and life. 【Wide Range of Use】You can put our Ozone Generator Deodorizer in the refrigerator, washing machine, car, pet room, shoe cabinet, closet, bedroom, bathroom or even backpack, luggage anywhere you feel you need help. Most importantly, this is a healthy and perfect gift for family and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619C9nNZM7S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zerosky","source_asin":"B094D1V4KL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-974392","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094D1V4KL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094D1V4KL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
