window.products.push({"id":974548,"name":"SearchI Super Fit Stretch Removable Washable Short Dining Chair Covers Slipcover Protector, Spandex Fabric Chair Cover for Dining Room, Hotel, Ceremon","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tnkDcNGvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Premium Dining Chair Slipcovers】Made of high quality polyester and spandex material featuring two-way high stretchy, comfortable and wrinkle resistant, no ironing required; dining chair covers secure fit with sewn-in elastic hem protecting from slipping and more fixed. 【Perfect Fit】Stretch Kitchen chair covers fit for normal and high back parson chairs. Dining chair slipcovers fit chair back height 17.7-23.6\"; chair seat length and width 14-19.7\"; thickness:1.5-4 inches. Kindly measure your chairs before ordering.(Please allow 0.5-1 inch error due to manual measurement) 【Widely Usage】SearchI dining room chair covers can transform your old chair to brand new and extend the life of the chair to save your money.Removable protective chair covers can be used for dining room, hotel, kitchen, restaurant, wedding banquet, meeting, celebration, dinner, ceremony, home decoration, etc. 【Fashion Design 】Various printed and solid color chair covers for your choices as they update furniture to fit your evolving style; Modern parson chair slipcovers will protect your chair from stains, dirt and pet's scratch and bite, perfect for homes with kids, dogs and cats, allowing it to perfectly combine style and durability. 【Easy Care】SearchI chair covers machine washable, easy to clean and maintenance. Easy to install, just in a few steps to get a fitted and brand new look.We are committed to providing you with quality dining chair slipcovers and friendly service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tnkDcNGvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SearchI","source_asin":"B07XL39D9W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-974548","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XL39D9W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XL39D9W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":974549,"name":"ECR4Kids Adjustable Stacking Shelf with Full Edge, Bookcase, Grey Wash","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dH3atMzgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Store and display books, shoes, or personal belongings with the ECR4Kids Adjustable Stacking Shelf. The adaptable storage tray is designed to be used independently or inter-stacked with up to three additional units for a vertical space-saving storage solution. The tray is adjustable with the ability to be set flat or at a forward tilt. The full edge perimeter keeps pens, art and crafts, and school supplies from rolling off the tilted shelf. The multipurpose storage is ideal for use in a living room as an end table for coffee table books and magazines, or an open-faced book display in a bedroom or dorm room for easy access to literature. Teachers can prepare redundant shelves for students in the classroom for collaboration tables, then easily collect and stack them for a quick clean up. The bookcase is constructed from durable rubberwood with a tough UV lacquer that seals the wood surface and resists scratching. A UV inhibitor makes furniture resistant to ultraviolet light and yellowing. Natural rubberwood is extremely durable and will hold up to everyday use at school or in the home. The shelf comes in a variety of finishes to mix n match; additional shelves are sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dH3atMzgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ECR4Kids","source_asin":"B0BXX8X1GP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-974549","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXX8X1GP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXX8X1GP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":974550,"name":"Jessie Steele Bib Josephine Café Toile Apron","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/415nAcFzOXL._AC_.jpg","description":"While hosting a luncheon, evoke the charm of Parisian cafés with this cute vintage-style hostess apron from Jessie Steele. The Josephine Café Toile bib apron not only protects a frock from flour dust while baking, but it also makes a sophisticated, fashionable statement. Crafted in a linen cotton blend, the apron features classic Café Toile pattern in black against a crisp white backdrop. The apron ties on to accommodate different body sizes and coverage desires with 26-1/2-inch long neck straps and 27-inch long waist straps in black grosgrain. Topped by a 9-1/2-inch wide bib, the apron complements many figures with a drop waist and a flirty ruffled skirt. A waist pocket offers storage for bracelets and rings while cooking, and is embellished by a removable black grosgrain bow. To care for the apron, machine wash and dry the apron. Jessie Steele offers matching oven mitts, tea towel, tote bag, dishwashing gloves, and a child-sized bib apron for separate purchase. Made in the USA, the apron measures 30 inches long by 27 inches wide and it weighs 1 pound upon shipping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/415nAcFzOXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jessie Steele","source_asin":"B000TK4BLU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-974550","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000TK4BLU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000TK4BLU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
