window.products.push({"id":974566,"name":"Stainless Steel Pastry Cutter, Kitchen Handheld Professional Dough Blender Flour Mixer Whisk Baking for Pasta, Pie Crust and Cake","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.37,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SfOxxUfeL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Description:  The handle is smooth and extremely comfortable and easy to grip and use. The metal sides are flat and sturdy, so the dough or pastry could pop up between the cutting blades. It is not like the wooden dough cutter, it could help you save much energy and very easy to clean. It is a good kitchen tool for you.    Features:  Our dough cutter is made of food-grade and high-quality stainless steel, very healthy and safety to be used as a kitchen tool. And it is also very durable, so it will not break, bend or rust. The smooth handle is nice and extremely comfortable and easy to grip and use.  The five strong cutting blades are unique in shape, and they have sharp edges and are flat on the sides so they slice and blend easily.  It is not like a dough cutter with round wires. The cutting blades do not bend in the slightest, even when pushing down on them or twisting them. The metal sides are flat and sturdy, so when the pastry or dough pops up between the cutting blades it doesn't go in every direction. Our dough cutter is not only a practical dough cutter, but also a dough blender or a mixer.    Specifications:  Condition: 100% Brand New and High Quality  Material: Stainless steel  Color: Shown as picture  Width: Approx. 4.5cm / 1.78inch  Height: Approx. 11.3cm / 4.45inch  Handle Length: Approx. 10.1cm / 3.98inch  Weight: Approx. 73g    Package Included:  1 x Stainless Steel Dough Cutter    Please Note:  1. Please allow 1-3mm errors due to manual measurement 2. Monitors are not calibrated same, item color displayed in photos may be showing slightly different from the real object. Please take the real one as standard.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SfOxxUfeL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yosoo","source_asin":"B07RGK4D6V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-974566","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RGK4D6V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RGK4D6V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":974567,"name":"Enesco Trail of Painted Ponies Eye Dazzler Hanging Ornament, 2.6\", Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xf6RO2HwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Trail of Painted Ponies celebrates the magic of the horse as an artistic canvas, the rich culture of America, and the unique talents of independent artists. The artists behind this exquisite collection come from all different backgrounds, and the inspirational stories behind each design are as heartfelt as they are beautiful. Before the turn of the 19th century, the Navajo switched from making traditional Native American blankets to weaving brilliantly colored tapestries with hand-spun wool that featured fantastic geometric shapes and bold color palettes never before seen. This groundbreaking shift gave birth to what is now known as the Eye Dazzler rug. These weavings not only offered Navajo artisans the chance to express their individual artistry, freedom and ceremonial musings, they also influenced others who drew inspiration from these rich and colorful designs, and incorporated the aesthetic into other mediums, such as Painted Ponies. About Us: Enesco is committed to bringing joy every day. The premier global destination for high-quality giftware, and home décor, our prestigious family of brands includes: Department 56 Village, Gregg Gift, Foundations, Jim Shore Heartwood Creek, Disney Traditions by Jim Shore, Walt Disney Archives Collection, Disney Showcase Collection, Disney by Britto, Pusheen, Designs by Lolita, Our Name Is Mud, and many more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xf6RO2HwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Enesco","source_asin":"B07MCCQN7G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-974567","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MCCQN7G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MCCQN7G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
