window.products.push({"id":974577,"name":"EOE Nonstick Frying Pan, Granite Coating Skillet with Anti-Warp Base, Stainless Steel Handle - Nonstick Fry Skillet for Gas, Electric, Induction Cookt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r-zT9eqmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍳 COOK WITH IT FOR LONGER - Our nonstick pan is crafted from hard, anodized aluminum and features an anti-warp bottom. These allow our nonstick cookware to effectively stand up to the rigors of daily cooking, suitable for use on all stove tops including induction, glass & gas. Oven safe to 500 F. 🍳 EFFECTIVE & DURABLE COATING - EOE nonstick frying pan's feature 5 layers of non-stick granite coating for superior nonstick functionality. This frying pan is designed with classy granite looking interior which is made out of all natural coating colors. 🍳 EASY CLEANING AND SCRATCH RESISTANCE - Reinforced nonstick coating provides unprecedented non-stick cooking performance for easy food release, easy clean up, and better browning and searing,just wipe it with a paper towel or rinse it with water. 🍳 STURDY BODY - The nonstick skillet inside is made of aluminum, which is more durable and sturdy. 🍳 SMART HEAT CONDUCTION - EOE nonstick frying pan is suitable for various stoves and quickly transfer heat to the food, evenly heating, making a great cooking performance. Suitable for all stove, including induction cooktop/Oven/Dishwasher. 🍳 COMFORTABLE GRIP HANDLE - Our hollowed-out triangular stainless steel handle minimizes heat build up to keep your hands safe from burns. The Handle of EOE frying pans is especially designed with comfort, ease of use and secure handling in mind. Handle remains cool-to-touch during the busiest of stovetop cooking. The handle of the induction skillets provides extra support and balance when lifting and pouring. 🍳 BEST CHRISTMAS GIFT FOR THE BEST YOU - EOE frying pan will be a perfect gift for your mom, lover, family and friends forever. It is a best wish and unique and special gift idea for Christmas and a surprise for your special person as Birthday gifts, Thanksgiving Anniversary or any other occasion. 🍳 SAFE COOKING - This nonstick frying pan is 100% free of PFAS, PFOA, GenX, APEO, lead or cadmium. Stop worrying about harmful substances leaching into your food and harming your family's health. Great for busy families to keep meals as healthy and toxin-free as possible. 🍳 SMALL TIPS - Please put a small amount of oil in the pan to achieve a better non-stick effect（Hot pan cold oil）. Don't let the pan boil dry or use excessive heat for too long as over heating may damage the frying pan and it's non-stick properties. 🍳 LIFETIME SERVICE - EOE provides a 90-day money-back guarantee and free replacement within 6 months. In addition, we provides every customer with a lifetime service guarantee. We are here to offer you only the best quality products designed to make your life easier.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r-zT9eqmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EOE","source_asin":"B09C5Q2FJQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-974577","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C5Q2FJQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C5Q2FJQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
