window.products.push({"id":974660,"name":"FATORRI L Shaped Computer Desk, Industrial Office Desk with Shelves, Rustic Wood and Metal Corner Desk for Home Office (Rustic Oak, 59 Inch)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":239.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ipFhJhAtL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"[Reversible L-Shaped Desk]: The desk's shelf can be positioned on either the left or right side, allowing for flexible placement. The L-shaped design provides ample workspace without occupying too much office space. With a 59-inch wide desk top, you can comfortably accommodate three monitors and laptops. The desk is equipped with two-tier shelves and a long side shelf underneath, offering generous storage space for books and essential supplies. By keeping clutter out of sight, it helps maintain a clean and organized workspace while adding a touch of industrial charm. [Industrial Chic Design]: This large computer desk combines clean lines with rustic flair, creating a refreshing and contemporary look that adds an on-trend touch to your workspace. The stylish design aims to inspire you to work to the best of your ability the moment you sit down, creating a productive and engaging environment. [Durable Materials & 100% Wobble-Free]: This corner desk is crafted from high-quality MDF and features a long-lasting heavy-duty metal frame, ensuring durability and longevity. The desk's stability is greatly reinforced by the two-piece connection mesh frame, resulting in a super-strong desk that remains wobble-free even after assembly. Its sturdy construction makes it perfect for long-term use, providing a reliable workspace that can withstand daily activities. [Dimensions & High Weight Capacity]: The overall size of this computer desk is 59.06”L x 55.12”W x 30.12”H, providing a spacious work area. To ensure a high weight capacity, we have used a 1.18-inch thick chunky computer desk top, and additionally added a support tube under the desk top and along the long shelf. With these enhancements, the desk top can easily support up to 400 lbs of weight, making it suitable for heavy-duty use and providing peace of mind for your belongings. [Super Easy to Assemble]: This large office desk can be assembled in approximately 40 minutes. We have included clear instructions, numbered parts, and all the necessary tools in the package to facilitate a smooth assembly process. If you have any questions or need assistance before or after purchasing, please feel free to email us at any time. We are committed to providing excellent customer support and will respond to your inquiries within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ipFhJhAtL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FATORRI","source_asin":"B0B4ZFHDN1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-974660","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4ZFHDN1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4ZFHDN1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
