window.products.push({"id":974803,"name":"Posh Organizers 7 Tier, 6 Large Drawers, Flip Top Tray with Removable Dividers Acrylic Makeup Organizer - Clear","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nR4fZ5KSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Effortlessly de-clutter your drawers and organize your vanity with a Posh Ultimate Acrylic Makeup Organizer. With this premium acrylic 7-tier cosmetic organizer, you can have all your lipsticks, compacts, foundations, concealers and palettes neatly stored in different clear drawers. Being one of the most spacious makeup organizers on the market, it can hold hundreds of products for easy access. Besides saving you space and time, it’ll add a stylish chic look to any vanity table or bathroom countertop.  The Posh Ultimate Acrylic Makeup Organizer has a flip top tray to allow taller items such as fragrances, lotions, foundations, sprays, and nail polish to stand upright with the lid open. The top tray comes with 3 pieces of acrylic dividers that you can use to create up to 6 separate compartments for even greater organization. The lid can be closed to help prevent dust from gathering on your beautiful black compacts or jewelry accessories. You have 6 clear drawers below to store and organize all your makeup essentials. 5 drawers are generously sized at 11\" length, 6.25\" width, and 1.25\" deep inside. The bottom drawer is extra large at 11\" length, 6.25\" width, and 2.5\" deep inside. The deeper bottom drawer lets you hold most nail polish upright and stack up to 4 palettes on top of each other. Total dimensions of the Posh Ultimate Makeup Organizer is W: 11.8″ (30 cm), D: 6.9″ (17.5 cm), H: 14.9″ (38 cm)  Posh Organizers are made with the highest quality acrylic material available. Our super thick acrylic creates the sleek and polished appearance that makes our products unique. Our organizers are also clearer and more glass-like than others thanks to our unique laser cutting and edge smoothing process. The combination of superior acrylic and skilled craftsmanship ensures that each product stays sturdy and beautiful for years.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nR4fZ5KSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Posh Organizers","source_asin":"B01KUEH4TA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-974803","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01KUEH4TA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01KUEH4TA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
