window.products.push({"id":974826,"name":"Puple Butterflies Soft Throw Blanket All Season Microplush Warm Blankets Lightweight Tufted Fuzzy Flannel Fleece Throws Blanket for Bed Sofa Couch 80\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716naB8Ea8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material & Design - Flannel Blanket Is Made Of 115% High-Quality Microfiber Polyester, It Offers A Gentle Soft And Warm Comfy Feel. It Is Soft To Touch, Easy To Care For, Silky And Lightweight. It'S Wrinkle And Fade Resistant, Not Too Thick To The Point Where It Will Overheat You. It Gives You The Perfectly-Balanced Heat For All Seasons Use. Three Size - (1) 50 X 40 Inch Small Suitable For Kids; (2) 60 X 50 Inch Medium Suitable For Teens; (3) 80 X 60 Inch Large Suitable For Adults.The Picture Shows The 80 X 75 Inch Large Size. It Is Only For Reference, Please Choose The Size You Need According To Your Actual Situation. Decorative - The Super Soft Flannel Fleece Blanket Offers You The Superior Comfort To Make Sure You Stay Comfortable, Overall Comfort And Generous Size Make It Ideal To Cover Any Bed Or As A Spare Blanket For Guests, Dorm Or College. Whether It Is A Rural Style Or Modern Style, You Can Match It. The Very Fashionable Design Adds A Unique Feeling To Your Room. Drape The Print Blanket Over A Chair, Couch Or Bed To Uplifts The Look Of Your Living Room Or Bedroom. Multifunctional: Though It's The Ultimate Winter Blanket It Is Suitable For All Seasons. The Super Soft Print Blanket Is Suitable For Using On The Couch, Bed, and Chair. You Can Cover Yourself With It In A Chilly Night Watching Tv, Staying Up For Studies, or Napping During Work Breaks. The Print Flannel Blanket Can Not Only be Used As A Scarf In Winter But Also Used As An Air Conditional Blanket. Easy Care - It Is Easy To Clean. Wash Simply Separately In Cold Water. It Dries Quickly On Tumble Dry On Low Heat. No Ironing Or Expensive Cleaning Required. Do Not Bleach. Easy To Store And High Color Fastness, Very Easy To Care And Save Your Money.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716naB8Ea8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yaateeh","source_asin":"B0BLBVX8CC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-974826","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLBVX8CC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLBVX8CC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":974827,"name":"Home Intuition Toilet Brush & Holder Set, Bathroom Bowl Scrubber with Holder (2 Pack, Bronze)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817lMvrbwkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TOILET BRUSH & HOLDER SET MADE STYLISH: Equip your bathroom with a modern, sleek and stylish toilet brush set that is so discreet and elegant it blends seamlessly with the décor of any restroom. Perfect for your master bathroom, the guest bathroom or any full or half bathroom of your house, dorm, cottage, RV or even camper! DEEP CLEANING FOR SPOTLESS CLEAN TOILET BOWLS: Featuring a long detachable handle for easy use, a rounded replaceable toilet brush that can get to those hard-to-reach areas with their long, strong, heavy duty bristles, this toilet bowl brush can instantly scrub away even the most persistent stains. Yes, even those annoying rust stains under the rim that look impossible to get rid of! THE MOST DISCREET HOLDER FOR ANY BATHROOM: Unlike bulky and outdated toilet brush sets, the Home Intuition toilet cleaner brush set comes with an ultra-sleek and compact holder that keeps the brush right next to the toilet but still out of sight. Even the handle of the brush matches the color of the holder, for a well-concealed final look you are sure to love. ODOR PROOF & SPLASH RESISTANT FOR EASY USE: The secure odor-proof enclosure of the toilet scrubber brush into its matching holder eliminates any unpleasant smells or messy drips in the most discreet way. Plus, the splash-guard of the brush allows for deep cleaning all while shielding your hands from gross splashes and droplets. PREMIUM QUALITY TO ENJOY FOR YEARS: Made of the highest quality wear-resistant and durable materials, this toilet brush set will serve you for years to come. Along with its minimal design that looks effortlessly stylish, this freestanding toilet scrubber set is a beautiful and practical addition even the tiniest bathrooms could use!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817lMvrbwkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Intuition","source_asin":"B0BXBBL4CN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-974827","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXBBL4CN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXBBL4CN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
