window.products.push({"id":974925,"name":"Mayshion Air Pressure Kitchen Red Wine Opener Popper Bottle Pumps Corkscrew Cork Out Tool","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Ys-9BgL5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Feature： Air pump Wine Opener uses air and a strong needle for fast cork removal.  This air pump wine opener is a simple, easy and fast way to open up a bottle of wine with the hassle of pulling and twisting. Simply slid the needle in, pump a few times and the cork is out. How to use: 1.Use the foil cutter to remove the foil cap.  2.Insert the needle into the wooden cork and make sure the needle passed through, cover the bottle by transparent cover.  3.Grasp firmly the transparent cover by left hand; hold the outer tube by the right hand. press the outer tube to pump air into the bottle by push and pull until the cork is slide out of the bottle.(Generally 5-10 pumps per bottle is appropriate)  4.Push the transparent slider to make the cork away from the needle. CAUTION: Don’t use this corkscrew for plastic cork and sparkling wine.  Please keep the corkscrew out of children’s reach, because the needle are very sharp.  If the bottle is defective, the times of pumping must not over 12 pumps per bottle.  When air can't be pumped into the bottle while the wooden cork still can't be slided out, choose other wine opener. improper use will damage this product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Ys-9BgL5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mayshion","source_asin":"B00VB8X1AG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-974925","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00VB8X1AG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00VB8X1AG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
